stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Reload: Browser returns to a cached private page
  Reload --> CheckingSession: Start a fresh document
  CheckingSession --> PrivateView: Session verified
  CheckingSession --> SessionEnded: Session denied or changed
  CheckingSession --> LoadFailed: Session verification unavailable
  LoadFailed --> CheckingSession: Normal page retry
  note right of PrivateView
    Ask Doc, Lead review, and Deal updates restore unsent text for the same account and record or chat.
    A confirmed save or send clears its draft. Sign-out or account change clears all drafts.
  end note
